15481216627466322","type":"quoted"}],"text":"TBS称日剧完全虚构，央视斥为“狡辩”，要求“悔改”、停播道歉\n\n10月29日，央视发文称日剧《VIVANT》第二季是“披着文艺外衣的政治工具”，将TBS社长有关“完全虚构”“无意贬低特定国家”的解释斥为“狡辩”，要求其“正视历史、真诚悔改，停播相关剧集、向中国人民道歉”。 https://t.co/h2AXzBvXuf https://t.co/CU4I3oLBeB","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2116394739255656680"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-31T04:47:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116391612146217315"],"id":"2116391612146217315","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4244,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我敢保证，99%的人分不清：\n\n哪位是中国🇨🇳美女，哪位是日本🇯🇵美女，哪位是韩国🇰🇷美女！ https://t.co/AstUpDBM2l","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2116391612146217315"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-31T04:43:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116390576929333363"],"id":"2116390576929333363","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3311,"like_count":8,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2116382090505732124","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Ansem谈比特币短线交易：迟迟不按预期走势发展或是离场信号 \n\n知名交易员Ansem发文表示，时间是短周期交易中一个常被低估的风险管理因素。当他入场时预期价格快速波动，便希望市场能在较短时间内朝预期方向运行。如果比特币长时间徘徊在入场价附近、迟迟未按预期走势发展，他就会重新评估交易逻辑。 https://t.co/2ZDpUuJr49","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2116390576929333363"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-31T04:34:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116388191322190132"],"id":"2116388191322190132","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":37440,"like_count":50,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":10},"text":"中国科技巨头阿里巴巴星期六（10月31日）宣布，与美国苹果公司达成合作，将阿里巴巴旗下人工智能（AI）应用千问集成至苹果的AI平台苹果智能。 https://t.co/AuR7cZ9jjl","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2116388191322190132"},{"author_id":"1239457591417171973","created_at":"2026-10-31T04:28:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116386749299470508"],"id":"2116386749299470508","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":59,"impression_count":45013,"like_count":558,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21